# Lexsys Tech Stack

Authoritative dependency map from workspace `package.json` files and registry-declared consumer deps. **Do not add packages outside the correct layer.**

Related: [project-structure.mdc](./project-structure.mdc), [typescript.mdc](./typescript.mdc), [docs/contributors/STYLE.md](../../docs/contributors/STYLE.md), [docs/reference/tokens/TOKENS.md](../../docs/reference/tokens/TOKENS.md), [docs/reference/cli/CLI.md](../../docs/reference/cli/CLI.md), [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

---

## Version matrix (workspace)

| Package / tool | Where declared | Version (range) | Role |
|----------------|----------------|-----------------|------|
| **pnpm** | root `packageManager` | 10.33.0 | Workspace installs, `workspace:*` links |
| **Node** | root `engines` | `>=24 <25` | Runtime for build, CLI, and consumers |
| **TypeScript** | root dev / playground | `latest` → **6.0.x** resolved | Strict typing across monorepo |
| **Turbo** | root dev | `latest` | Task orchestration (`build`, `test`, `lint`, `typecheck`) |
| **tsup** | root dev | ^8.5.1 | ESM bundles for `cli`, `registry`, `tokens`, `ui` |
| **TypeScript (`tsc`)** | package build scripts | 6.0.x | Declaration emit (`--emitDeclarationOnly`) — tsup `dts` disabled pending TS 6 fix in tsup |
| **Vitest** | root dev | ^4.1.7 | Package tests (`vitest run`, threads pool) |
| **ESLint** | root dev | ^10.4.0 + `typescript-eslint` ^8.59.4 + `@eslint/js` ^10.0.1 | `src` + `test` per package; root `*.config.mjs` |
| **Prettier** | root dev | ^3.8.3 + `prettier-plugin-tailwindcss` ^0.8.0 | Formatting; Tailwind class order |
| **Tailwind CSS** | root dev / playground / CLI init | ^4.3.0 | Utility layer; v4 CSS-first config |
| **@tailwindcss/vite** | playground / CLI `init` | ^4.3.0 | Vite integration (required for Vite path) |
| **Vite** | playground / CLI scaffold | ^8.0.14 | Dev server and consumer app bundler |
| **@vitejs/plugin-react** | playground / CLI scaffold | ^6.0.2 | React Fast Refresh |
| **React** | ui peer / playground | peer `>=19`; playground **^19.2.6** | UI runtime |
| **@base-ui/react** | ui + registry items | ^1.5.0 | Headless primitives (internal to components) |
| **class-variance-authority** | ui + registry | ^0.7.1 | Variant definitions |
| **clsx** | ui + registry | ^2.1.1 | Conditional classes |
| **tailwind-merge** | ui + registry | ^3.6.0 | Conflict-safe Tailwind class merge |
| **lucide-react** | ui + subset of registry items | ^1.16.0 | Icons (overlays, menus, dialogs, etc.) |
| **prompts** | root + cli | ^2.4.2 | Interactive CLI prompts |

**Published on npm:** `@dalexto/lexsys` (entry), `@dalexto/lexsys-cli`, `@dalexto/lexsys-registry`. **Not published:** `@dalexto/lexsys-tokens`, `@dalexto/lexsys-ui` (reference-only).

