## Layer ownership

| Layer | Package | May depend on | Must not |
| ----- | ------- | ------------- | -------- |
| Infrastructure | root tooling | — | React, Base UI, Tailwind in tokens/registry |
| Tokens | `@dalexto/lexsys-tokens` | — (zero runtime deps) | Hand-written CSS in `src/` |
| UI | `@dalexto/lexsys-ui` | tokens, Base UI, CVA, clsx, merge, lucide | Consumer install API |
| Registry | `@dalexto/lexsys-registry` | tokens (styles) | React runtime deps |
| CLI | `@dalexto/lexsys-cli` | registry, prompts | Per-component install hardcoding |

Build order for playground: `tokens:build` → `ui:build` → playground. `dist/` is publish output; never deep-import another package's `src/`.

Scoped checks: `pnpm tokens:check` / `ui:check` / `registry:check` / `cli:check` — full gate: `pnpm check`. Script names: [SCRIPTS.md](../../docs/operations/SCRIPTS.md).

