## UI stack (summary)

Reference components in `packages/ui`; consumers get **copies** from registry templates, not `@dalexto/lexsys-ui`.

- **Deps:** tokens, `@base-ui/react`, CVA, clsx, tailwind-merge, lucide-react (subset)
- **Peers:** `react`, `react-dom` `>=19`
- **Styling:** Tailwind v4 utilities in `*.variants.ts` + generated CSS vars (`cssVarPrefix` from [generator.config.ts](../../packages/tokens/src/generators/generator.config.ts))
- **File split:** `Component.tsx`, `Component.types.ts`, `Component.variants.ts` — see [ui-components.mdc](./ui-components.mdc) and [STYLE.md](../../docs/contributors/STYLE.md)

Registry item `dependencies` arrays define per-component consumer npm deps — see [UI.md](../../docs/reference/ui/UI.md).

---

## Tokens (summary)

TypeScript-only source; CSS is **generated** — never hand-maintained.

```txt
primitives → brand → semantics → components
themes override semantics (not a fifth layer)
```

After token edits: `pnpm tokens:check` or `pnpm tokens:build`; when CSS/templates drift: `pnpm sync:all`. Full contract: [TOKENS.md](../../docs/reference/tokens/TOKENS.md). Verify: **`$token-verify`**.

---

## CLI (summary)

Reads registry metadata; idempotent installs; no silent overwrites. `lexsys init` wires Tailwind v4 + Vite (MVP). Per-item npm deps from `packages/registry/src/items/*.ts`. Full contract: [CLI.md](../../docs/reference/cli/CLI.md).

---

## Tailwind v4 (consumer minimum)

| Required | Pattern |
| -------- | ------- |
| CSS entry | `@import "tailwindcss";` then token/theme CSS |
| Vite | `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin |
| Monorepo scan | `@source` for linked package paths when classes live outside app tree |

Do not use legacy `@tailwind base/components/utilities`. Pin `tailwindcss` + `@tailwindcss/vite` together on init. Details: [STYLE.md](../../docs/contributors/STYLE.md).

---

## TypeScript (summary)

Strict ESM; `moduleResolution: "Bundler"` (apps) or `"NodeNext"` (cli/registry with `.js` extensions). Type-only imports; no `any`; public API via `package.json` `exports` only. Full patterns: [typescript.mdc](./typescript.mdc), [STYLE.md](../../docs/contributors/STYLE.md).

```bash
pnpm typecheck
pnpm playground:typecheck   # requires tokens + ui build first
```

